# The rulings: once a trigger has triggered, life totals no longer matter. Tied at 20, Preacher attacks Bot2 and both
# abilities trigger. With them on the stack Bot2 exiles its own Embereth Shieldbreaker with Swords to Plowshares and gains
# 2 (22), so Bot2 no longer has the tied-for-most life and neither does Bot1 - yet the Vampire token is made and Bot1 draws
# and loses 1 anyway. Combat damage then takes Bot2 from 22 to 20.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Preacher of the Schism
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
10 Swamp

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Embereth Shieldbreaker
Swords to Plowshares
Swamp
Swamp
10 Swamp

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Preacher of the Schism.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Embereth Shieldbreaker.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Preacher of the Schism > Bot2)
Bot2.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Embereth Shieldbreaker)
? Stack.Count = 3
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Life = 19
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Vampire Token.Token = true
Exile = Embereth Shieldbreaker
